publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T13:41:58.6385678Z               "message": "Add multi-team project associations\n\nThe existing single projects.team_id relation prevented a project from belonging to more than one team, unlike the compatible management contract. Add additive048 with organization-contained many-to-many relations, backfill legacy primary assignments, expose complete ordered relations, make attach/detach additive and repair the primary mirror and alert recipient expansion across team deletion.",
